# Runtime traps, all learned the hard way

- Every auto layout container must have fills explicitly set to an empty array
  on creation. The default white fill silently breaks dark and gradient sections.
- figma.getNodeByIdAsync requires setCurrentPageAsync first.
- Sections need 200px or more clearance or they absorb children from adjacent
  sections.
- resize() on an auto layout frame locks both axes. Set
  layoutSizingVertical='HUG' after creation to hug content.
- Licensed fonts (Canela, Sohne, Apercu) are not returned by
  listAvailableFontsAsync. Use Inter as a stand in and note the real family in
  the style description.

# Brand

Daybreak Fields (`KcKa8zfPY1IArc8QP9d1rW`) is the Figma brand file, not the
live site. Live web type is Inter and Space Mono. Do not put Canela, Sohne,
or Source Serif 4 on consumer surfaces.

Daybreak palette, eight tokens: Stone canvas, Night ink, Slate, Mark gold
(EBBB3E), Bronze, Nightfield, Skyfield, Hardware blue.
